        // ===== приветствие и панели =====
        "welcome": r#"🤖 Welcome to the anonymous proposal bot!

Just send your proposal, idea, or message here, and it will be anonymously reviewed by moderators.
Your identity will be hidden - moderators will only see the content of your message.

❓ What you can send:
• Text proposals
• Photos
• Documents
• Videos
• Video notes
• Audio and voice messages
• Stickers

Your proposal will be reviewed shortly!"#,
